  message: "Fixed by PR (pending): harmonised audit-findings 0013 fold-target for http_client from 'function' to 'call_site', matching the precedent audit-findings 0010 sub-case (a) set for abi_call. linkers/http.py:1319-1347 now emits kind='call_site' + meta['call_kind']='http' + meta['framework_role']='http_client'. The 18 misclassified http_client Symbols on self-analysis (1 production at packages/htrac-frontend/public/service-worker.js:54 plus 17 test fixtures) now correctly identify as call sites, not function definitions. hypergumbo dead-code-maybe stops flagging the production fetch(event.request) as dead. Audit-findings 0013 amended with a 2026-05-18 row note documenting the harmonisation rationale and the internal-inconsistency-resolution path. Quantitative claim: 18 → 0 misclassified kind='function' http_client Symbols; awaits bakeoff to confirm no broader regressions (e.g., centrality weighting, slice filters)."  # 8b85
